    "transcript": "Test 1 Part 1. Wedding arrangements at Clarence House Hotel. City view; photos; round tables; table decorations; printed menu; sandwiches; £5995; cake supplier; coordinator Sarah Izard; visit 15th October.",
    "formContent": "<div class=\"ielts-form-container\"><div class=\"form-section\"><div class=\"form-title\" style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:700;\">Wedding arrangements - Clarence House Hotel</div><p>Available date: 1st June</p><p>The Oxford Suite has:</p><ul style=\"line-height:2;\"><li>a dining room with a good view of the <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"1\" style=\"width:140px;text-align:center;\"></li><li>a private garden for <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"2\" style=\"width:140px;text-align:center;\"> and for the wedding ceremony</li><li>an area suitable for dancing</li></ul><p>The wedding package includes:</p><ul style=\"line-height:2;\"><li>use of the Oxford Suite</li><li>a three-course meal</li><li>+ room arranged with <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"3\" style=\"width:140px;text-align:center;\"> tables</li><li>+ table <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"4\" style=\"width:140px;text-align:center;\"> included</li><li>+ white tablecloths and chairs</li><li>+ personalised printed <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"5\" style=\"width:140px;text-align:center;\"></li><li>a late-evening buffet with a choice of <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"6\" style=\"width:140px;text-align:center;\"> and hot drinks</li></ul><p>Music: hotel will organise a band (not included in price)</p><p>Total cost of package: £ <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"7\" style=\"width:140px;text-align:center;\"></p><p>Can also recommend a <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"8\" style=\"width:140px;text-align:center;\"> supplier (new company)</p><p>Wedding coordinator Sarah <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"9\" style=\"width:140px;text-align:center;\"></p><p>Date arranged for visit: <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"10\" style=\"width:140px;text-align:center;\"> at 11.30 a.m</p></div></div>",
